|Bug Localizer|Approach|#<br>Scrns|H@5 H@10|RI of<br>H@10|#Bug<br>Top10|
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
|**Lucene**|Baseline|4|0.74<br>0.79|-|61|
|**Lucene**|Concat OBs|4|0.75<br>0.88|11.49%|68|
|**Lucene**|First OB|4|0.74<br>0.88|11.49%|68|
|**Lucene**|Individual OBs|4|0.77<br>0.87|9.85%|67|
|**BugLocator**|Baseline|3|0.59<br>0.71|-|56|
|**BugLocator**|Concat OBs|3|0.72<br>0.79|10.72%|62|
